@startuml
title Pati — Domain Event Sözleşmeleri ve Servis Sınırları
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
component "Reservation Service" as RS
component "Payment Service" as PS
component "Provider Service" as PR
component "Notification Service" as NS
component "Review / Trust Service" as TS
component "Health Service" as HS
component "Analytics Consumer" as AN
queue "Event Bus" as BUS
database "Schema Registry" as REG
RS --> BUS : ReservationCreated v1
RS --> BUS : ReservationAccepted v1
RS --> BUS : ServiceStarted / Completed v1
PS --> BUS : PaymentAuthorized / Captured v1
PS --> BUS : RefundCompleted / PayoutCompleted v1
PR --> BUS : ProviderVerified / Suspended v1
HS --> BUS : VaccinationDue v1
BUS --> NS
BUS --> TS
BUS --> AN
BUS --> PS : rezervasyon olayları
BUS --> RS : ödeme sonucu
REG --> BUS : schema validation
note bottom
Ortak envelope:
event_id, event_type, schema_version, aggregate_id,
occurred_at UTC, correlation_id, causation_id, tenant_id, payload.

Kurallar:
• en az bir kez teslim — consumer idempotent
• kişisel/sağlık verisi event payload'ında minimum
• sıra aggregate_id partition'ında korunur
• breaking değişiklik yeni major schema
• replay ve DLQ operasyon runbook'u zorunlu
end note
@enduml
